  "prompts": {
    "sw": "undefined\nALL face SOUTHWEST7 o'clock FRONT lower-left. Preserve near LEFT arm crossing IN FRONT of chest from screen-right shoulder to bow at screen-left, far RIGHT hand at cheek and far bent elbow partly hidden. At rest left hand screen-right bow, right empty. Skill raises empty right palm while left holds bow low. Never mirror.",
    "nw": "Use case: identity-preserve. Transparent 4 columns x4 rows tactical RPG animation sheet. Image1 is APPROVED JOB8 FINAL PROMOTION COSTUME and character identity; image2 POSE/ANATOMY only. Redraw every whole connected pose wearing exact image1 fixed set: same youthful face and slim body, black ponytail; GOLD/BRONZE metal brow circlet with small raised central crown around ponytail base; olive-green and bronze reinforced lamellar armor with GOLD edged shoulder guards, ivory sleeve cuffs, long olive-green gold-trimmed coat panels over ivory/navy inner layers, red belt cords, dark reinforced boots. This is a substantially more armored final rank than leather job7. Approved ornate brown-gold recurved sinew horn bow with jade-green ornament and short DARK BLUE tassel. Back quiver. No crossbow, sword, horse. Do NOT keep base brown vest or bare green cloth shoulders.\nKeep exactly image2's sixteen connected body poses, same body/head scale and handedness. Rows idle/walk/attack/skill. Columns four time frames. LEFT hand always holds ONE bow, RIGHT draws string or empty. Attack nock/draw/release/recover; release has no arrow. Final attack/skill matches first idle. Walk alternating feet, not whole-image sliding. Complete body no parts. Wide transparent gutters15% per cell, figure including bow max65% cell height. Identical foot baseline and body size all16. True transparent (remove gray background), no text grid floor shadow glow.\nALL face NORTHWEST11 o'clock BACK upper-left. Anatomical LEFT arm holds bow at screen-left, RIGHT arm draws at screen-right; preserve all pose-reference geometry.",
    "se": "Use case: identity-preserve. Transparent 4 columns x4 rows tactical RPG animation sheet. Image1 is APPROVED JOB8 FINAL PROMOTION COSTUME and character identity; image2 POSE/ANATOMY only. Redraw every whole connected pose wearing exact image1 fixed set: same youthful face and slim body, black ponytail; GOLD/BRONZE metal brow circlet with small raised central crown around ponytail base; olive-green and bronze reinforced lamellar armor with GOLD edged shoulder guards, ivory sleeve cuffs, long olive-green gold-trimmed coat panels over ivory/navy inner layers, red belt cords, dark reinforced boots. This is a substantially more armored final rank than leather job7. Approved ornate brown-gold recurved sinew horn bow with jade-green ornament and short DARK BLUE tassel. Back quiver. No crossbow, sword, horse. Do NOT keep base brown vest or bare green cloth shoulders.\nKeep exactly image2's sixteen connected body poses, same body/head scale and handedness. Rows idle/walk/attack/skill. Columns four time frames. LEFT hand always holds ONE bow, RIGHT draws string or empty. Attack nock/draw/release/recover; release has no arrow. Final attack/skill matches first idle. Walk alternating feet, not whole-image sliding. Complete body no parts. Wide transparent gutters15% per cell, figure including bow max65% cell height. Identical foot baseline and body size all16. True transparent (remove gray background), no text grid floor shadow glow.\nALL face SOUTHEAST5 o'clock FRONT lower-right. Anatomical LEFT arm holds bow at screen-right, RIGHT arm draws at screen-left. Preserve exact pose-reference geometry.",
    "scenario": "Use case: identity-preserve. Transparent 4x4 scenario idle sprite sheet of approved JOB8 final promotion archer. Same slim youthful face/gender black ponytail. GOLD/BRONZE brow circlet with small raised metal central crown; OLIVE-GREEN reinforced lamellar armor and gold/bronze shoulder guards, ivory sleeve cuffs and underskirt, green long coat panels with GOLD edges, red belt cords, dark reinforced boots. Match approved identity and complete costume. NO WEAPONS, no bow, arrows, quiver, weapon harness, scabbards. Both hands EMPTY naturally beside body. Four rows: NW11 BACK upper-left, NE2 BACK upper-right, SE5 FRONT lower-right, SW7 FRONT lower-left. Four columns breathing idle, feet planted, last returns to first. Constant human body/head size and foot baseline all16. Full connected figures only60% each cell height with15% clear transparent margins all sides. No grid text shadows effects. True transparent.",
    "seOrnament": "Edit ONLY bow ornament continuity in this 4x4 sprite sheet. Every bow in ALL sixteen cells must retain the SAME approved ornate golden-brown horn bow with small JADE GREEN bead and short DARK BLUE tassel. In rows3 and4 columns1,2,3 the raised bows lost that ornament; ADD jade and blue tassel hanging just below the handgrip, attached to bow, following gravity. Match the idle bow decoration, no enlargement. Keep all poses, exactly same arms/hands, crown armor clothes directions sizes, 4x4 layout and transparency unchanged. Do not add another bow, projectile, effects, text, floor, or move any figure. Whole characters remain connected.",
    "neOrnament": "Edit ONLY bow decoration continuity. In this back-facing NE 4x4 archer sheet, every raised bow in row3 columns1,2,3 needs the SAME small jade-green bead and short dark-blue tassel attached to bow below handgrip as the idle bow. Add them without changing any body or hand anatomy. LEFT far arm remains holding bow upper-right, RIGHT near low-bent arm draws/releases. Preserve all sixteen poses, armor and crown, full connected bodies, exact layout and sizes, transparent background. No extra bow, no effects or labels. Do not change any other cell.",
    "nwOrnament": "Edit only BOW ORNAMENTS in this 4x4 NW archer sheet. Rows3 and4 columns1,2,3 raised bows must retain the SAME golden-brown ornate bow and a small JADE GREEN bead with short DARK BLUE tassel attached BELOW GRIP. Currently these decorations disappear during attack/skill. Add them clearly but modestly, same size as idle. Preserve every single pose, LEFT bow hand and RIGHT draw hand, back upper-left direction, costume crown body sizes, transparency and grid layout. No extra bow, effects or text."
  },
